libEtPan is a mail purpose library. It will be used for low-level
mail handling : network protocols (IMAP/NNTP/POP3/SMTP over TCP/IP and
SSL/TCP/IP, already implemented), local storage (mbox/MH/maildir),
message / MIME parser.
